00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:57,890
那是神奇女侠吗
Is that Wonder Woman?

347
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:01,270
严格来说  那是个中国山寨版
Technically, it's a Chinese knockoff called

348
00:17:01,270 --> 00:17:03,590
叫快乐强壮的泳衣女士
Happy Strong Swimsuit Lady.

349
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:07,190
那我把话收回  这派对棒极了
Then I take it back; it's a great party.

350
00:17:07,550 --> 00:17:09,360
你自己坐在这儿生闷气吧
Well, you can sit here and sulk if you want.

351
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:11,560
我要去庆祝哈雷的第一个生日
I'm gonna go celebrate Halley's first birthday.

352
00:17:11,560 --> 00:17:14,350
这个派对是我计划的  你屁忙都没帮
Which I planned with no help from you.

353
00:17:14,350 --> 00:17:15,510
你要干什么
What are you doing?

354
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:18,540
这是蹦跳城堡  我要进去蹦
It's a bounce house! I'm gonna go bounce in it!

355
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:23,440
进去前  应该要先脱鞋啊
You're supposed to take your shoes off before you go in there!

356
00:17:25,720 --> 00:17:27,190
你知道吗
You know what?

357
00:17:27,420 --> 00:17:30,300
我女儿的生日派对已经让我压力很大了
I'm stressed about my daughter's birthday party.

358
00:17:30,300 --> 00:17:31,820
我不要再看你脸色
I don't need your attitude.

359
00:17:31,820 --> 00:17:33,130
我很努力把派对办起来
Well, I worked really hard on this,

360
00:17:33,130 --> 00:17:35,170
你连句谢谢都没说
and you haven't even said thank you.

361
00:17:35,170 --> 00:17:36,860
真抱歉  谢谢啊
Oh, I'm sorry. Thank you.

362
00:17:36,860 --> 00:17:38,020
谢谢你把你生活里
Thank you for blaming me

363
00:17:38,020 --> 00:17:39,890
一切不顺都怪到我头上
for everything that's wrong in your life!

364
00:17:39,890 --> 00:17:42,660
谢谢你抛弃了我们的友谊
Thank you for walking out on our friendship!

365
00:17:42,660 --> 00:17:44,130
不客气
You are welcome!

366
00:17:44,130 --> 00:17:46,630
我也谢谢你这些年来不断吐槽我
And thank you for mocking me for all of these years!

367
00:17:46,630 --> 00:17:49,530
谢谢你这么多槽点
Thank you for making it so easy!

368
00:17:50,860 --> 00:17:52,660
你为什么这么混蛋
Why are you being such a jerk?

369
00:17:52,660 --> 00:17:56,890
因为你是我最好的朋友  而你伤了我的心
Because you're my best friend and you hurt my feelings!

370
00:17:56,890 --> 00:17:59,650
你也是我最好的朋友  你也伤了我的心
Well, you're my best friend and you hurt my feelings!

371
00:18:01,860 --> 00:18:04,780
真不敢相信你居然推我
I can't believe you shoved me!

372
00:18:06,500 --> 00:18:08,280
我也不敢相信你居然推我
Well, I can't believe you shoved me!

373
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:10,010
但还挺好玩的  不是吗
But it was kind of fun, wasn't it?!

374
00:18:10,010 --> 00:18:12,690
-是的  再推一次  -乐意至极
- It was! Do it again! - Gladly!

375
00:18:14,380 --> 00:18:16,720
好  现在同时互推
Okay, now at the same time!

376
00:18:18,620 --> 00:18:19,980
真是太赞了
Oh, oh, that was awesome!

377
00:18:19,980 --> 00:18:22,410
好  这次先膝盖着地  然后站起来
Yeah, okay, this time, knees, then feet.

378
00:18:22,410 --> 00:18:24,640
一  二  三
One, two, three.

379
00:18:26,810 --> 00:18:29,590
再来  再来
Again! Again!

380
00:18:33,310 --> 00:18:34,110
大家好呀
Hello.

381
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:35,510
你们来了
You made it.

382
00:18:35,510 --> 00:18:36,580
你们俩感觉怎么样
How you two feeling?

383
00:18:36,580 --> 00:18:37,970
好点了
Oh, a little better.

384
00:18:37,970 --> 00:18:39,100
那些书应该叫
Those books should have been called

385
00:18:39,110 --> 00:18:41,570
《草原茅厕》才对
Little Outhouse on the Prairie.

386
00:18:42,490 --> 00:18:45,220
哈雷醒了  准备好参加派对啦
Halley's awake and ready for her party!

387
00:18:45,220 --> 00:18:46,010
我这就上来
Be right up!

388
00:18:46,010 --> 00:18:47,020
我想看小寿星女
Ooh, I want to see the birthday girl.

389
00:18:47,020 --> 00:18:48,560
我很想见她
I'd love to see her.

390
00:18:48,560 --> 00:18:52,320
别那么快  重新穿上这胸罩需要点时间
Walk slow, it takes a while to get this bra back on.

391
00:18:54,810 --> 00:18:56,180
其实...
You know...

392
00:18:57,020 --> 00:18:58,940
你的生日还没过
it's still your birthday.

393
00:18:59,410 --> 00:19:00,560
确实
It is.

394
00:19:00,560 --> 00:19:04,800
我们两个  都感觉好多了
And... we are both... feeling better.

395
00:19:06,390 --> 00:19:07,870
确实
We are.

396
00:19:08,390 --> 00:19:10,280
那间弹跳屋里没人
And there's no one in that bounce house.

397
00:19:10,280 --> 00:19:11,730
哎
No.

398
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:13,590
太棒了
Great.

399
00:19:14,100 --> 00:19:15,770
我们去里面跳一会
Let's go jump for a bit,

400
00:19:15,770 --> 00:19:18,160
再找个房间交媾吧
and then find a bedroom to have coitus in.

